# Local Issues

Copy to LOCAL_ISSUES.md (ignored by Git). Use stable L-prefixed IDs and retain
this counter when purging completed history. Required fields are problem,
acceptance criteria, and status; add shared-issue links or notes when useful.
After validation, when ready to commit, move completed entries to
CLOSED_LOCAL_ISSUES.md with a short resolution and validation receipt.

**Last local issue ID assigned:** L0

## Entry format

    ## L<next integer>: Short title
    Status: Open
    Problem: Describe the observable problem.
    Acceptance criteria: State the conditions for completion.
